CAPTION=: 'Easy wrapper for Dictionary addon'

DESCRIPTION=: 0 : 0
This addon provides some extensions to data/dict:
- type & shape inference upon first put, no need to specify.
- string options, rather than awkward boxed parameters
- jsymbol extended with s verb to work as s:.
- two wrapper verbs easydict and easysym in z-locale 
)

VERSION=: '0.0.2'

RELEASE=: 'j9.8'

FOLDER=: 'data/easydict'

FILES=: 0 : 0
README.md
easydict.ijs
)

DEPENDS=: 'data/dict'
